#: rc.cpp:34
msgid ""
"Here you can change the keyboard layout. If you are from Germany you want to "
"choose 'de'."
msgstr ""
"Hier jy kan verander die sleutelbord uitleg. As jy word van Duitsland jy wil "
"hê na kies 'de'."

