#: rc.cpp:62
msgid ""
"The top text shows what you should write. When you press a key this "
"character will appear on the bottom line. The topline and the bottom line "
"should be equal when you are finished. At the end of the line you have to "
"press enter."
msgstr ""
"Die bo teks vertoon wat jy moet skryf. Wanneer jy druk 'n sleutel hierdie "
"karakter sal verskyn op Die bodem lyn. Die boonste lyn en Die bodem lyn moet "
"wees gelyk Wanneer jy word klaar gemaak. Na Die einde van Die lyn jy het na "
"druk invoer."

